  "description": "ELAHIJ crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group C 2/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C210 H195 Ho5 O45,4(C7 H8). From the CIF bond table, Ho1 (Ho) has 8 O neighbors; Ho2 (Ho) has 8 O neighbors; Ho3 (Ho) has 8 O neighbors; Ho1A (Ho) has 8 O neighbors; Ho2A (Ho) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 10 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.511-5.079 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 87.98-160.93°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Ho5(OH)5(abzm)10]·4C7H8 (C238H227Ho5O45; bulk desolvated C210H195Ho5O45). Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 5 OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
